{"step_index":165,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-17T14:32:28Z","content":"A comprehensive **Technical Specifications & Agile User Stories** document has been created and formatted with standard engineering architecture standards:\n\n🔗 **[HR Agentic Solution - Functional Specs & User Stories (MVP 1)](https://docs.google.com/document/d/190GK62Mq6ogskpDSTs55Ff4OqBmLzD3-JoEzreiIUqQ/edit)**\n\n---\n\n### Key Epics & Specifications Included in the Document\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                               EPIC & USER STORY BREAKDOWN MATRIX                                │\n├──────────────────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Epic 1: Identity & UI Management     │ • US-1.1: Test Persona Selector & Signed JWT Injection   │\n│                                      │ • US-1.2: Multi-Turn Conversation State & 30m Timeout    │\n│                                      │ • US-1.3: Interactive Human-in-the-Loop Confirmation     │\n├──────────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Epic 2: Safety & Governance          │ • US-2.1: Input Safety & Prompt Injection Interception   │\n│                                      │ • US-2.2: PII / SPII Data Redaction in Logging Stores    │\n│                                      │ • US-2.3: Orchestration-Level RBAC & Tenant Isolation    │\n├──────────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Epic 3: Grounded Policy Q&A (RAG)    │ • US-3.1: Policy Ingestion, Chunking & <= 1h Sync        │\n│                                      │ • US-3.2: Semantic Search & Clickable Deep-Link Chips    │\n│                                      │ • US-3.3: Domain Containment & Hallucination Fallback    │\n├──────────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Epic 4: Employee Self-Service (HCM)  │ • US-4.1: Real-Time Leave Balance Query (in Work Days)   │\n│                                      │ • US-4.2: Leave Submission with Business Calendar Logic  │\n│                                      │ • US-4.3: WorkWeek Resilience & Circuit Breaker          │\n├──────────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Epic 5: Support Desk (ITSM/HRSD)     │ • US-5.1: Incident Ticket Status & Activity Query        │\n│                                      │ • US-5.2: Incident Creation with Priority/Category Maps  │\n│                                      │ • US-5.3: Duplicate Ticket Detection (15-min window)     │\n│                                      │ • US-5.4: Ticket Lifecycle & End-User Cancellation       │\n├──────────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Epic 6: Resilient Orchestration      │ • US-6.1: Equipment Procurement Chained Workflow (UC-2.1)│\n│                                      │ • US-6.2: Medical Leave Workflow with DLQ Alert (UC-2.2) │\n└──────────────────────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n### What is Specified for Every User Story:\n1. **Persona & Goal (`As a... I want... So that...`):** Clear business value and actor context.\n2. **Technical Details & System Adapters:** Explicit endpoint routes, timeout budgets, and state handling.\n3. **Data Contracts:** Schemas for the `X-Authenticated-User` signed JWT, `Idempotency-Key` headers, and API error envelopes.\n4. **Edge Cases & Failure Recovery:** Behavior during upstream 5xx outages, weekend exclusions, and duplicate submissions.\n5. **Gherkin Acceptance Criteria:** Complete `Given-When-Then` test scenarios ready for QA automation and developer testing.\n\n---\n\n### Complete Deliverables Reference:\n* 📄 **Revised & Approved BRD (Clean):** [HR Agentic Solution BRD (MVP 1 - Revised & Approved)](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1gW-lwRWN1sltc0jUolYhFktNlzJ3App5d7z4AkivZlI/edit)\n* 📝 **BRD with Tracked Changes & Comments:** [HR Agentic Solution BRD - With Tracked Changes](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1tHkqwbPOJ2HUlmTliaR-Ip0gnpAhxiIrXKcJxu0qlT4/edit)\n* 🚀 **Functional Specifications & Agile User Stories:** [HR Agentic Solution - Functional Specs & User Stories (MVP 1)](https://docs.google.com/document/d/190GK62Mq6ogskpDSTs55Ff4OqBmLzD3-JoEzreiIUqQ/edit)"}
